<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<addon
  id="visualization.zunradio"
  version="21.0.1"
  name="ZUN rádio scéna"
  provider-name="Underground Media Management s.r.o.">
  <requires>@ADDON_DEPENDS@</requires>
  <extension
    point="xbmc.player.musicviz"
    library_@PLATFORM@="@LIBRARY_FILENAME@"/>
  <extension point="xbmc.addon.metadata">
    <platform>@PLATFORM@</platform>
    <license>GPL-2.0-or-later</license>
    <website>https://zunradio.cz/</website>
    <email>info@undergroundmediamanagement.cz</email>
    <summary lang="en_GB">Red dots and rings moving to the beat, as on zunradio.cz</summary>
    <summary lang="cs_CZ">Červené tečky a kruhy v rytmu hudby jako na zunradio.cz</summary>
    <description lang="en_GB">The full screen scene of ZUN radio: red dots, rings and waves on black that react to the bass and the highs of the music. Together with the ZUN radio add-on it shows the cover of the track on air in a red card that pulses with the bass, with the artist and title below. It works with any music.</description>
    <description lang="cs_CZ">Scéna ZUN rádia přes celou obrazovku: červené tečky, kruhy a vlny na černé, které reagují na basy a výšky hudby. S doplňkem ZUN rádio ukazuje obal právě hrající skladby v červené kartě, která pulzuje s basy, pod ní interpreta a název. Funguje s jakoukoli hudbou.</description>
    <news>21.0.1 (2026-11-15)
- The red card is drawn only in the ZUN radio scene, no longer behind the skin menus
21.0.0 (2026-11-08)
- First version</news>
    <assets>
      <icon>resources/icon.png</icon>
      <fanart>resources/fanart.jpg</fanart>
    </assets>
  </extension>
</addon>
